omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G4jZR1AR-dUQ7kNvwEeW6mu&_nc_oc=AdqZLeH-Z3WTfRf3YSixBxYzQgidQ90sM1BZsHhiQIYHtqhhL56cSMyy8HUGGuPfulc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-AqFJK1cjrY9UAiZ4hv1CuaJsJmXe2tptBocAyO0Uz4Q&oe=6A3018B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DJM791VdpFsQ7kNvwEc11NS&_nc_oc=Adqc5-GsKMb6hnFkqbcRqUT7wYLvcef2hRZrv6WjNm7j9iCe_q168fCQTFJJON_Cl2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_0fhFAhdPyC52bFimNHUxkrnP3ZqxdBQJ5A60ITMj-UQ&oe=6A301A16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CzGluVtyuoYQ7kNvwFTZUza&_nc_oc=Ado5Dh5MzU18Is_z05paBmes_CBmdowQF5aLlnLib09wRrRJnGI48vIHTLn4n3DmuFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9tvKAm0uhlnrXkywUpcystGp4vT-oAxJ9171aicoSDQg&oe=6A2FF6F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://